{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Give to the wise</b> — He added to explain the advantage of the wise over the fool, and the meaning: for the wise grows wise on his own from what is given to him, and likewise 'the righteous increases learning,' because they make it known to him, and it is a doubled matter."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:41.688981992Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}